  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7e1c7a661635554d8114ecebd4bcd44, type: 3}
  m_Name: The Training
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  text: He taught me strikes that split bark and vows that split friends. Deception
    sweetened every command, Vanity dressed it in honor, and Jealousy measured my
    worth against everyone I loved. The forest held its breath each time I borrowed
    strength. I began to fear the echo more than the shout.
